<title>USA: Washington Federal increases dividend.</title>
<headline>Washington Federal increases dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Washington Federal Inc, parent of Washington Federal Savings said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.24 cents per share from $0.23 cents per share.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable January 24, 1997 to common stockholders of record on January 8, 1997.</p>
